  m_Name: RiverGalleyDock
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BuildingDefinition
  id: RiverGalleyDock
  displayName: Galley Dock
  description: A stone quay and a boathouse, a galley on the slip. Trains War Galleys
    with archers on deck; its ferry seats 5. Build it on the shore of open water.
    Its boats patrol the water and shoot at raiders near the shore; send troops to
    land the water cuts off and its ferry carries them across.
